  "description": "Test build of Trundle as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Trundle so King's Tribute heals for a share of every enemy unit that dies near him (the main pack: only the units he kills), Frozen Domain stays frozen on the ground where he cast it and amplifies his heals (the main pack: it follows him), Pillar of Ice is terrain enemies cannot walk through (the main pack: only a slow), Chomp steals a share of the bitten unit's own attack and Subjugate a share of the champion's own armour and magic resistance, its drain healing him for what it takes (the main pack: fixed percentages). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
